      "sha": "a59a43a8343d960a58cbe7a1f9fba2d2ce431856",
      "date": "2026-01-02T07:35:49Z",
      "message": "fix: Handle schema drift in merged_gw.csv when API adds new columns (#221)\n\nFixes #203 - FALSE instead of 0 in saves column\n\nThe issue occurred because:\n1. FPL API added 7 new mng_* columns mid-season (GW22)\n2. merge_gw() appended new data without updating the header\n3. This caused column misalignment (data shifted by 7 positions)\n\nChanges:\n- Rewrote merge_gw() to detect and handle schema changes\n- Added regenerate_merged_gw() to rebuild merged file from scratch\n- Updated main() with proper CLI interface and backwards compatibility\n- Regenerated data/2024-25/gws/merged_gw.csv with correct schema\n\nNew columns properly handled:\n- mng_clean_sheets, mng_draw, mng_goals_scored\n- mng_loss, mng_underdog_draw, mng_underdog_win, mng_win\n\nUsage:\n  python collector.py regenerate data/2024-25/gws\n  python collector.py merge 38 data/2024-25/gws\n\nCo-authored-by: Mr-Neutr0n <neutr0n.git@gmail.com>"
    },
